」と呼ばれたことに腹をたてるヨーコ。それとは裏腹に、店では楽しい夏祭りイベントが開催される事となる。"},"tvdb":{"title":"Episode 5","synopsis":"Nozomu and Shank go looking for showpiece items for the store.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"link":"27024","sourcePath":"/play/ame-iro-cocoa-side-g.GXX-c/wWpDe","sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"episodeNumber":6,"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"『なんでも手伝います』ポスターを貼っていたヨーコとマリナ。落ち込んだ芽留と一緒に現れたのは、海辺で出会った女子校生のもう片方であるイクミだった。芽留は飼いネコの《ここあ》を探して欲しいとヨーコたちに依頼する。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/293647/episodes/602ae09dd4b0c.jpg","externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"14039","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"104712","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37747","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68482","scope":"s5","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"293647","scope":"s5","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"seasonNumber":5,"metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"『なんでも手伝います』ポスターを貼っていたヨーコとマリナ。落ち込んだ芽留と一緒に現れたのは、海辺で出会った女子校生のもう片方であるイクミだった。芽留は飼いネコの《ここあ》を探して欲しいとヨーコたちに依頼する。"},"tvdb":{"title":"Episode 6","synopsis":"Nozomu gets a little more help in the form of Nikola, Noel, and Haruka.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"link":"27295","sourcePath":"/play/ame-iro-cocoa-side-g.GXX-c/77WHG","sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"episodeNumber":7,"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"ここあを探すヨーコ。ベンチの下をのぞき、顔を上げるとそこにはちょうどここあの姿が！ しかし……ここあは何かに気付き走り出してしまう。慌てて追おうとするヨーコだったが、そこにいたのはケイトで――。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/293647/episodes/602ae0aeb8a39.jpg","externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"14039","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"104712","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"37747","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68482","scope":"s5","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"293647","scope":"s5","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"seasonNumb